[00:54.83] Sprawling on the fringes of the city
[00:58.55] In geometric order
[01:01.54] An insulated border
[01:04.10] In-between the bright lights
[01:07.29] And the far unlit unknown
[01:12.13] 
[01:16.99] Growing up it all seems so one-sided
[01:20.47] Opinions all provided
[01:23.56] The future pre-decided
[01:26.63] Detached and subdivided
[01:29.44] In the mass production zone
[01:33.64] Nowhere is the dreamer
[01:36.33] Or the misfit so alone
[01:41.23] 
[01:46.17] Subdivisions
[01:46.99] In the high school halls
[01:49.60] In the shopping malls
[01:51.84] Conform or be cast out
[01:54.40] Subdivisions
[01:55.17] In the basement bars
[01:57.76] In the backs of cars
[02:00.08] Be cool or be cast out
[02:05.17] Any escape might help to smooth
